  {
   "id": "seg4-00",
   "text": "再看以太坊这样的 PoS 链。",
   "spoken": "再看以太坊这样的 PoS 链。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg4-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.616,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 3.388
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-01",
   "text": "它要求三分之二的质押投票，才能让一个检查点最终确定。",
   "spoken": "它要求三分之二的质押投票，才能让一个检查点最终确定。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg4-01.mp3",
   "start": 4.436,
   "dur": 5.208,
   "speechStart": 4.534,
   "speechEnd": 8.796
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-02",
   "text": "最终确定以后，区块不能回滚，除非三分之一的质押被罚没。",
   "spoken": "最终确定以后，区块不能回滚，除非三分之一的质押被罚莫。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg4-02.mp3",
   "start": 9.864,
   "dur": 5.328,
   "speechStart": 9.962,
   "speechEnd": 14.378
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-03",
   "text": "bug 让大量验证者掉线，链继续出块，但检查点不再最终确定。",
   "spoken": "bug 让大量验证者掉线，链继续出块，但检查点不再最终确定。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg4-03.mp3",
   "start": 15.412,
   "dur": 5.832,
   "speechStart": 15.51,
   "speechEnd": 20.414
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-04",
   "text": "某个客户端占比超过三分之一，它的 bug 就能让最终性停下。",
   "spoken": "某个客户端占比超过三分之一，它的 bug 就能让最终性停下。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg4-04.mp3",
   "start": 21.464,
   "dur": 5.688,
   "speechStart": 21.562,
   "speechEnd": 26.312
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-05",
   "text": "超过三分之二，它的 bug 可能把错误的链最终确定。",
   "spoken": "超过三分之二，它的 bug 可能把错误的链最终确定。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg4-05.mp3",
   "start": 27.372,
   "dur": 4.704,
   "speechStart": 27.47,
   "speechEnd": 31.232
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-06",
   "text": "所以客户端多样性，也是共识安全的一部分。",
   "spoken": "所以客户端多样性，也是共识安全的一部分。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg4-06.mp3",
   "start": 32.296,
   "dur": 4.392,
   "speechStart": 32.394,
   "speechEnd": 35.834
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-07",
   "text": "2023 年 5 月，Prysm 和 Teku 处理旧投票时负载过高。",
   "spoken": "2023 年 5 月，Prysm 和 Teku 楚理旧投票时负载过高。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg4-07.mp3",
   "start": 36.908,
   "dur": 6.0,
   "speechStart": 37.006,
   "speechEnd": 42.065
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-08",
   "text": "主网先后约 25 分钟和约 1 小时，没有最终确定。",
   "spoken": "主网先后约 25 分钟和约 1 小时，没有最终确定。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg4-08.mp3",
   "start": 43.128,
   "dur": 4.776,
   "speechStart": 43.226,
   "speechEnd": 47.059
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-09",
   "text": "Lighthouse 没受影响，这次没有资金损失。",
   "spoken": "Lighthouse 没受影响，这次没有资金损失。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg4-09.mp3",
   "start": 48.124,
   "dur": 4.032,
   "speechStart": 48.222,
   "speechEnd": 51.317
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-10",
   "text": "按攻击者的质押份额看，有四条线。",
   "spoken": "按攻击者的质押份额看，有四条线。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg4-10.mp3",
   "start": 52.376,
   "dur": 3.744,
   "speechStart": 52.474,
   "speechEnd": 55.295
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-11",
   "text": "约 33%，能阻止最终性，代价是不活跃惩罚，逐步削减他的质押。",
   "spoken": "约百分之 33，能阻止最终性，代价是不活跃惩罚，逐步削减他的质押。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg4-11.mp3",
   "start": 56.34,
   "dur": 7.032,
   "speechStart": 56.438,
   "speechEnd": 62.521
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-12",
   "text": "约 34%，在能控制消息时序时，造成双重最终性，会被最大比例罚没。",
   "spoken": "约百分之 34，在能控制消息时序时，造成双虫最终性，会被最大比例罚莫。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg4-12.mp3",
   "start": 63.592,
   "dur": 6.84,
   "speechStart": 63.69,
   "speechEnd": 69.618
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-13",
   "text": "约 51%，能主导分叉选择，审查交易，做短程重组。",
   "spoken": "约百分之 51，能主导分岔选择，审查交易，做短程虫组。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg4-13.mp3",
   "start": 70.652,
   "dur": 5.976,
   "speechStart": 70.75,
   "speechEnd": 75.809
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-14",
   "text": "约 66%，能在没有诚实方配合时，最终确定自己的链，只能靠社会层恢复。",
   "spoken": "约百分之 66，能在没有诚实方配合时，最终确定自己的链，只能靠社会层恢复。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg4-14.mp3",
   "start": 76.848,
   "dur": 6.96,
   "speechStart": 76.946,
   "speechEnd": 82.969
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-15",
   "text": "另一种攻击，用的是旧私钥。",
   "spoken": "另一种攻击，用的是旧私钥。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg4-15.mp3",
   "start": 84.028,
   "dur": 3.096,
   "speechStart": 84.126,
   "speechEnd": 86.292
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-16",
   "text": "已经退出的验证者，取回了质押，不会再被罚没。",
   "spoken": "已经退出的验证者，取回了质押，不会再被罚莫。",
